            <div xml:id="d672">

                <pb facs="0572" n="456" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg456"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/11988.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Navy to
                        Admiral Fletcher.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-12T12:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 12, 1914, 12 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>No action will be decided one way or the other until the President arrives.
                    Direct Mayo not to press salute until ordered.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Daniels</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
